# Route: guide 51 of 53 of the simulator's completionist route for NightElf
# (1445 of 1459 eligible quests, 164.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 60 to
# 60, 20 quests, 6.6 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Stranglethorn Vale, Swamp of Sorrows, Badlands): Booty Bay -> Mosh'Ogg
# Ogre Mound -> Wild Shore -> Jaguero Isle -> Booty Bay -> Wild Shore -> Booty
# Bay -> Wild Shore -> Zuuldaia Ruins -> Splinterspear Junction -> Agmond's
# End.
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Message in a Bottle (630; King
# Mukla 51); An Ambassador of Evil (762; Ambassador Infernus 42).
#
# Left out: Uniting the Shattered Amulet (3627): the route takes them here but
# cannot finish them (the coverage report's missed quests).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Ribbly Screwspigot (4136), Kibler's Exotic Pets (4729),
# En-Ay-Es-Tee-Why (4862).

